g with lush, pedestrian-friendly walkways perfect for jogging and leisure strolls.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Family Spaces: </strong>Community features like BBQ areas, sports courts, and picnic spots foster a family-centric lifestyle.</li><li><strong>Curated Retail &amp; Dining:</strong> Enjoy unique shopping and dining experiences within the community for a vibrant, connected lifestyle.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1181,"cta":{"id":1938,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_e166f9f671.jpg","hash":"map_e166f9f671","name":"La Rosa by Dubai Properties"},"style":null,"title":"The Perfect Blend of Serenity and Connectivity in Dubai’s Prime Locale","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Nestled in the heart of Villanova, La Rosa offers the perfect blend of convenience and tranquility. Villanova, a freehold community developed by Dubai Properties, is nestled within Dubailand. Launched in 2016, it offers villas and townhouses with a charming Mediterranean theme. Situated in the southeastern part of Dubailand, Villanova is also conveniently close to The Villa and Dubai Outlet Mall.</p><ul><li>15 minutes to Al Habtoor Polo Resort &amp; Club</li><li>16 minutes to Dubai Academic City</li><li>16 minutes to IMG Worlds of Adventure</li><li>18 minutes to Arabian Ranches</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3337,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/La_Rosa_at_Villanova_315c862735.pdf","hash":"La_Rosa_at_Villanova_315c862735","name":"La Rosa by Dubai Properties"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":null,